#: src/features/migrations/ConnectStep.tsx
msgid "Gmail lets other apps read about 1.5 GB a day over IMAP, so a mailbox of many gigabytes takes days. Google Takeout exports it as one file that uploads as fast as your connection allows. Import that first, then come back here with an app password for the newer mail and the switch."
